#
# An rdfs:subClassOf cycle. Three classes rather than two, so
# the error message has to name the ring in order rather than just the pair.

@prefix :     <http://example.com/broken#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:Company a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Employer .
:Employer a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Business .
:Business a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Company .
